REPORT zhcl_singleton.

CLASS zcl_singleton DEFINITION FINAL CREATE PRIVATE.

  PUBLIC SECTION.
    CLASS-METHODS get_instance RETURNING VALUE(ro_instance) TYPE REF TO zcl_singleton.
    METHODS: get_value RETURNING VALUE(rv_value) TYPE i.
    METHODS: set_value IMPORTING iv_val TYPE i.

  PRIVATE SECTION.
    DATA: lv_value TYPE i.
    CLASS-DATA: go_instance TYPE REF TO zcl_singleton.
    CLASS-METHODS create_instance RETURNING VALUE(rv_instance) TYPE REF TO zcl_singleton.
      
ENDCLASS.

CLASS zcl_singleton IMPLEMENTATION.
  METHOD get_instance.
    IF go_instance IS NOT BOUND.
      go_instance = create_instance( ).
    ENDIF.
    ro_instance = go_instance.
  ENDMETHOD.
  METHOD create_instance.
    rv_instance = NEW zcl_singleton(  ).
  ENDMETHOD.
  METHOD get_value.
    rv_value = go_instance->lv_value.
  ENDMETHOD.
  METHOD set_value.
    go_instance->lv_value = iv_val.
  ENDMETHOD.
ENDCLASS.
      
**********************************************************************

START-OF-SELECTION.

  DATA: lo_obj TYPE REF TO zcl_singleton.
  DATA: lo_obj2 TYPE REF TO zcl_singleton.

  lo_obj = zcl_singleton=>get_instance( ).

  lo_obj->set_value( 1 ).
  cl_demo_output=>display( lo_obj->get_value(  ) ).

  lo_obj2 = zcl_singleton=>get_instance( ).
  cl_demo_output=>display( lo_obj2->get_value(  ) ).
